Package: notification-hub-gui-deps
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Notification Hub <tsiemens@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, libcairo2-dev, libgirepository-1.0-dev, pkg-config, gcc, python3-dev
Description: Native dependencies for the Notification Hub desktop client
 Installs the GTK and WebKitGTK runtime and the headers needed to build
 PyGObject and pycairo in an isolated Python tool environment.
